# VibeFinance — Backend Environment Configuration Template
# Configure your settings and API keys here. Never commit your real secret keys to source control.

# Google Gemini Official API Configuration
# Get your Gemini API key from Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/
GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GCP_API_KEY
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# Application Security
SECRET_KEY=vibefinance-super-secret-jwt-key-2026-production-ready
